MATERIAL SYMBOLS, IN EVERY ANDROID APPLICATION
----------------------------------------------

The Android host draws each icon of StateUI's set (`Icon`) from a Material
Symbols drawable, which it puts among every Android application's resources:
lib/StateUI/StateUI.Android/Resources/drawable/stateui_icon_*.xml, the 24 dp
outlined Android vector drawables of the Material Design icons, each renamed
for the icon it draws. One change in each file: its tint names the platform's
attribute, `?android:attr/colorControlNormal`, where Google's names AndroidX's
`?attr/colorControlNormal`.

